  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MED.E.A. &#x2013; Cultural Mediation and Support to the Police Immigration Offices</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Built on the experience of IOM Italy&#x2019;s IBG activities implemented in the past six years in partnership with the Ministry of Interior, the proposed project represents the consolidated measure to support the Italian Border Police authorities at selected sea, air and land borders through a skilled pool of 185 cultural mediators (CMs), specialized in identification and fingerprinting procedures, disembarkation procedures, EU asylum and human rights law and standards. IOM will deploy this specialized team of mediators to ensure that the authorities continue to have access to a high standard of specialized personnel, be able to deal with migratory pressure for the country in a comprehensive border governance approach and disseminate the best practices developed in the past years.</narrative>
  </description>
